# SDKMAN per-project SDK pin.
# The root pom.xml compiles with --release 25 and the enforcer requires [25,), so an older JDK fails to build.
#
# How it applies:
#   - With `sdkman_auto_env=true` in ~/.sdkman/etc/config, the JDK switches
#     automatically when you cd into this directory.
#   - Otherwise, run `sdk env` once after cd'ing in (and `sdk env install` if
#     the version below is not yet installed).
#   - `make` reads it directly, so make targets use this JDK either way.
java=25.0.1-tem
